{
    "title": "FaceTec Demo",
    "description": "FaceTec Demo App - 3D Liveness & 3D Face Matching\r\n\r\n*Please Do Not Rate as a Consumer App; this is for Demo Purposes Only.\r\n\r\nFaceTec proves human Liveness, and matches 3D FaceMaps to both Photo ID\u2019s for Onboarding and to stored 3D FaceMaps. FaceTec has performed hundreds-of-millions of Liveness Checks for users in +170 countries.\r\n\r\nFaceTec is the only 3D Face Authenticator that has a $600,000 Spoof Bounty Program for Levels 1-5 and is Level 1&2 Certified. FaceTec has been proven in 3rd Party testing to be secure against spoof photos, videos, masks, video injection, camera hijacking, and more. FaceTec authenticates users with proprietary 3D facial recognition algorithms combined with unrivaled Liveness & 3D Depth Detection. FaceTec\u2019s AI uses patented perspective distortion analysis and makes FaceTec the most powerful biometric authenticator ever created. Learn more at www.Liveness.com.\r\n\r\nUniversal Software, runs on 10 Billion smart devices & PCs with webcams\r\nVerifies 3D Depth & Human Liveness for onboarding & password replacement\r\n3D:3D FaceMap Matching rated at 1/12,800,000 FAR @ <1% FRR \r\n3D:2D Face Matching rated at up to 1/950,000 FAR @ <1% FRR \r\n$100,000 Spoof Bounty Program Levels 1-5 - More info at www.SpoofBounty.com\r\nUsers can access their accounts from multiple devices and do not need to re-enroll\r\nNo observable Bias for Skin-tone, Age, or Gender (unlike 2D Liveness & Face Matching)\r\nSelfie-style ZoOm-in interface is fast, easy, and intuitive\r\nCertified by a NIST/NVLAP Lab - Level 1 & 2 to ISO 30107-3\r\n3.9MB Device SDK is easily added to any mobile App or webpage\r\n\r\nFaceTec\u2019s Developer Accounts are free. Get one here: https://dev.facetec.com and add the SDK to your App/webpage with just a few lines of code. Please contact us with any questions and for more information.",
    "descriptionHTML": "FaceTec Demo App - 3D Liveness &amp; 3D Face Matching<br><br>*Please Do Not Rate as a Consumer App; this is for Demo Purposes Only.<br><br>FaceTec proves human Liveness, and matches 3D FaceMaps to both Photo ID\u2019s for Onboarding and to stored 3D FaceMaps. FaceTec has performed hundreds-of-millions of Liveness Checks for users in +170 countries.<br><br>FaceTec is the only 3D Face Authenticator that has a $600,000 Spoof Bounty Program for Levels 1-5 and is Level 1&amp;2 Certified. FaceTec has been proven in 3rd Party testing to be secure against spoof photos, videos, masks, video injection, camera hijacking, and more. FaceTec authenticates users with proprietary 3D facial recognition algorithms combined with unrivaled Liveness &amp; 3D Depth Detection. FaceTec\u2019s AI uses patented perspective distortion analysis and makes FaceTec the most powerful biometric authenticator ever created. Learn more at www.Liveness.com.<br><br>Universal Software, runs on 10 Billion smart devices &amp; PCs with webcams<br>Verifies 3D Depth &amp; Human Liveness for onboarding &amp; password replacement<br>3D:3D FaceMap Matching rated at 1/12,800,000 FAR @ &lt;1% FRR <br>3D:2D Face Matching rated at up to 1/950,000 FAR @ &lt;1% FRR <br>$100,000 Spoof Bounty Program Levels 1-5 - More info at www.SpoofBounty.com<br>Users can access their accounts from multiple devices and do not need to re-enroll<br>No observable Bias for Skin-tone, Age, or Gender (unlike 2D Liveness &amp; Face Matching)<br>Selfie-style ZoOm-in interface is fast, easy, and intuitive<br>Certified by a NIST/NVLAP Lab - Level 1 &amp; 2 to ISO 30107-3<br>3.9MB Device SDK is easily added to any mobile App or webpage<br><br>FaceTec\u2019s Developer Accounts are free. Get one here: https://dev.facetec.com and add the SDK to your App/webpage with just a few lines of code. Please contact us with any questions and for more information.",
